msgid ""
"This section is for developer information related to \"non-standard\" RTF "
"vehicles based on ArduPilot."
msgstr "本节提供基于 ArduPilot 的「非标准」RTF 飞行器的开发者相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/ready-to-fly-rtf-vehicle-developer-information.rst:12
#: 3337e537e6ee4b07aa08a2936eea1a21
msgid ""
"ArduPilot-based UAVs are often very similar from a developer perspective; "
"developers upload standard firmware direct to the flight controller using "
"Mission Planner (or other GCS software). This section is for vehicles that "
"use a non-standard approach, including modified source, different approaches"
" for uploading firmware, support for companion computers, etc."
msgstr ""
"从开发者角度来看，基于 ArduPilot 的无人机通常非常相似；开发者使用 Mission "
"Planner（或其他地面站软件）直接将标准固件上传到飞控。本节适用于采用非标准方式的飞行器，包括修改源码、不同的固件上传方式、支持伴飞计算机等。"
